      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261214">V/V</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261216">SSE2</para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1261218">Convert two packed double precision floating-point values in xmm2/mem to two single precision floating-point values in xmm1.</para>
      </td>
     </tr>
    <tr>
     <td colspan="2"><para unique="1261220">VEX.128.66.0F.WIG 5A /r</para>
